@startuml
title Hunter Ranch source files and derived handoffs
top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
file "Original DEM / LiDAR\nand acquisition metadata" as source
file "Original imagery\nand course references" as imagery
database "QGIS geographic masters\nGeoTIFF + GeoPackage" as gis
file "Hole export package\nHeight PNG + overlay\nMarkers + coordinate record" as package
file "Blender master\nSource + working geometry" as blender
file "FBX mesh\nStable material slots" as fbx
component "Unreal test map\nMaterials + collision" as unreal
component "Course gameplay adapter\nTee + cup + scoring\nIntegration work required" as adapter
file "Validation record\nMeasured results + corrections" as checks

source --> gis : inspect / prepare ground
imagery --> gis : verify / trace layout
gis --> package : aligned export
package --> blender : map / shape / calibrate
blender --> fbx : export copy
fbx --> unreal : import / configure
package --> adapter : manual marker handoff
adapter --> unreal : connect play
unreal --> checks : measure / test
checks ..> gis : correct geography
checks ..> blender : correct geometry
checks ..> adapter : correct gameplay
@enduml
